# Recorded bags and ad-hoc debug/session logs (not source). Individual
# rosbags run 175MB-881MB (feasibility_gate/ros2_ws) -- past GitHub's
# 100MB hard file limit and not worth a Git LFS setup (tried 2026-09-11:
# ~14GB at measured upload speed would take ~10h and exceed the free
# 1GB/month LFS quota). Per-run CSVs/logs/reports ARE committed --
# regenerable rosbags stay local only; see results/feasibility_gate/README.md
# and results/route2_probe/README.md.
/ros2_ws/rosbags/
/ros2_ws/run_logs/
/ros2_ws/run_logs_flight1_backup_*/
/ros2_ws/*.log
/results/feasibility_gate/*/rosbag/
/results/route2_probe/*/rosbag/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
